mlxflow 0.8
1. Read Files   invoices/; pattern=*.txt
2. <each review_one; on_error=skip>   [file] -> [text]
     1. Read Text   (input:1)
     2. Gate                    CLM 8B; "Ready to pay as-is: PO number present,
                                line items add up to the total, bank details
                                unchanged? tags: approve, hold"
        -> { approve: 3 | hold: 4 }

     3. Template                "APPROVE        {1}"
        -> 8

     4. Score       (1)         CLM 8B; "How serious is the problem for
                                accounts payable? tags: minor, major, blocking"
        -> { minor: 5 | major: 6 | blocking: 7 }

     5. Template    (1)         "HOLD-MINOR     {1}"
        -> 8

     6. Template    (1)         "HOLD-MAJOR     {1}"
        -> 8

     7. Template    (1)         "HOLD-BLOCKING  {1}"
     8. Template                "{1}"
3. Sort         direction=asc   # approvals first, then holds (blocking before major, minor)
4. Join Text    separator="\n\n---\n\n"
5. Save Text    invoice-desk.md
